            "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:59:00.278335+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 2 we are selling off armored vests and picking up some ability power and cooldown reduction. We definitely want charged plating because you should be able to build ult quickly so that extra ability and armor will be awesome. You will also pick up Dragon\u2019s Incinerator this round and this you will always keep, it\u2019s part of what makes your rally so good. If you have the extra money to splurge on nano cola without giving up the amount of ability power you should have by the time you use your first ult then grab that instead of multi-tool. If you have an extra 1K grab either attack speed which i recommend if there is another Brig or grab weapon power just to do a bit more damage. You will still be playing a bit slower for the most part except when popping rally. Whatever happens don\u2019t let them break your shield.",
