            "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:59:00.278335+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is where we start varying a bit more, I personally prefer to grab the bigger shield however if I\u2019m finding it difficult to get close enough to hit the enemy team for inspire or I\u2019m not getting enough hits with my shield throw then I grab Mender Bender instead. This will help get inspire going by just bashing which you should be doing often still for that shield throw. Also if I find they are staying just out range of my whipshot then grab chain extender, this I normally don\u2019t because I normally have to give up some ability power for it however sometimes it is necessary to get that money to help build to make this rally even more lethal. You definitely want catalytic converter because that\u2019s just going to help you build ult so quick and you\u2019ll have rally often. At this point you should be such a nuisance that you feel targeted. If your shield is being broken way too often grab Valkyrien Core to help it regen faster once it\u2019s completely broken.",
