            "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:59:00.278335+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 4 we are just looking at more ability power, we want your whipshot, shield bash and shield throw to hurt. It\u2019ll also help with all this healing. If you find yourself being jumped often grab Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive for some survivability. Based on the amount of money you have just see what combination will give you the absolute most ability. Chain Extender and Valkyrian Core still are options if you absolutely need them but by this point you should be so lethal that they aren\u2019t necessary. You can definitely be more aggressive outside of rally just always be mindful of your shield being broken. If you don\u2019t have the cash to get what I have set for this round see what combination you can make with the optional items that gets you the most ability power.",
