            "created_at": "2025-09-26T17:59:00.278335+00:00",
            "notes": "In an ideal world this is what we want this build to look like, however it all depends on how much cash you were able to farm, if you need to give up anything start with Cybervenom as that isn\u2019t going to give you the most ability power for your money. I\u2019ve put in some optional items as always to give you some choices based on the amount of money you have. You are dangerous oustide of rally and even more so when you rally. You can literally 1v1 tanks if you play smart. Shield bash, hold, throw shield, whipshot, shield again. Whack them a bit with your mace, shield and hopefully by now you are about ready to bash again. Practice this, live this, and have fun!",
